        "title": "Fast Castle → 4 Scouts + Scorpions (+ Monks)",
        "detail": "Accelerated Fast Castle (~20–22 vills), then Stable + Blacksmith, mass ~4 Scout Cavalry + Scorpions with a couple of Monks. Best on resource-rich maps: 2+ boar, 8 sheep, 3–4 deer.",
