        "source": "kiritastrich",
        "sourceUrl": "https://t.me/kiritastrich/1451"
      },
      {
        "title": "Full Feudal + Market age-up",
        "detail": "Play full Feudal with a Market and buy the age advance; the gold-mining bonus funds a large gold pool for gold units.",
        "source": "kiritastrich",
        "sourceUrl": "https://t.me/kiritastrich/1432"
      }
    ],
    "buildNote": "Top pick for the scouts+scorps build: the Scout-line auto-upgrades + free Light Cavalry armor make the 4-Scout spam essentially free to tech, and faster gold funds Scorpions + Monks. Clean gunpowder transition (Chemistry is free; gunpowder techs −50%).",
    "recommendations": [
      "Abuse the free Scout upgrades and faster gold — go heavy on Scorpions with a few Monks for conversion/heal.",
      "Transition into Hand Cannoneers + Bombard Cannons in Imperial (free Chemistry, cheap gunpowder techs).",
      "Do NOT rely on trash: you have no Elite Skirmisher and no Halberdier."
    ],
